/users/dmlary/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-02T15:33:19Z","updated_at":"2026-07-02T15:33:19Z","body":"Added a comment in #118228 around reproduction: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118228#issuecomment-4866714092\r\n\r\nThe important note is that the GDScript file must have already been loaded by Godot successfully before you introduce the syntax error.\r\n\r\nI also rebuilt the latest pushes and verified they do resolve the issue.  In this video:\r\n- start with good gdscript, already loaded into Godot\r\n- introduce syntax error in external editor (`self` -> `slf`)\r\n- move to a different location within the gdscript file\r\n- switch over to Godot\r\n- click on syntax error path\r\n- editor jumps to line with syntax error\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4bd80ec3-297a-4a60-9f39-84533aa90559\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4867481196/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4930471804","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118245#issuecomment-4930471804","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118245","id":4930471804,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJeEHfA","user":{"login":"dmlary","id":857742,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1Nzc0Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/857742?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary","html_url":"https://github.com/dmlary","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-09T23:27:10Z","updated_at":"2026-07-09T23:46:26Z","body":"Hi, is there anything needed to help push this towards approval for 4.7.1?  I'm happy to demonstrate it breaking on 4.7, and fixed with this patch applied to directly to master.  I'm just looking for how else I can provide support here.\r\n\r\nEdit: Realized it's just easier to see the difference when I show 4.7 with the issue next to this PR.\r\n\r\n### Issue demonstration on 4.7\r\n\r\nTwo windows, Godot 4.7.stable on the left, neovim on the right.\r\n* scroll down in door_base.rb to a line with `self`\r\n* edit to change `self` to `slf` (syntax error) and save file\r\n* error message appears in Godot's output panel\r\n* switch to Godot, and error message appears a second time (expected)\r\n* click on error message\r\n* neovim jumps to line 1 in door_base.gd\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4ad33ff8-fc9a-4cdb-8826-4451ce7c1e7d\r\n\r\n### Fix demonstration on this PR branch\r\n\r\n\r\nTwo windows, Godot 4.7.stable on the left, neovim on the right.\r\n* mouseover the Godot version to show its the PR build (wish the hash were in there)\r\n* scroll down in door_base.rb to the same line with `self`\r\n* edit to change `self` to `slf` (syntax error) and save file\r\n* error message appears in Godot's output panel\r\n* Move to a different location in door_base.rb (less impressive when the cursor doesn't even move when I click on the error message)\r\n* switch to Godot, and error message appears a second time (expected)\r\n* click on error message\r\n* neovim jumps to line 82, containing `slf`\r\n* I change `slf` back to `self`\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/060dbf65-8b70-4dc9-9999-ae41704e9c42\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4930471804/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4932745732","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118245#issuecomment-4932745732","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118245","id":4932745732,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJgO6BA","user":{"login":"Infiland","id":88491175,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4NDkxMTc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88491175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland","html_url":"https://github.com/Infiland","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-10T06:48:31Z","updated_at":"2026-07-10T06:48:31Z","body":"@dmlary Do you have a commit to push or do my changes fix the issue for you?\r\nAlso I'm pretty sure one of t